note|n_draft|90|200|290|100|Title, schedule and candidates can change.;Eligibility can change.;Not visible to voters. No votes.;Activation needs: at least 2 candidates,;valid window, now < endsAt.
note|n_open|410|200|300|130|Setup is locked. Phase by the server clock:;now < startsAt: "Not started", no votes;startsAt <= now < endsAt: "Voting open";now >= endsAt: "Voting ended", no votes,;results are shown;Eligibility can change until voting is over.
note|n_closed|740|200|290|80|Final: never reopened.;No votes. Results are shown.;Eligibility is frozen.

